---
<html lang="en-CA">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Stump Grinding Paris ON | Grand River Stump Removal </title>
	<meta name="google-site-verification" content="XqBovmzz6BHm09OT5Dz7YDia5c6PMcEGVemykvY7ZWA" />
    <meta name="description" content="Professional tree stump grinding and yard restoration services in Paris Ontario, Brantford, and surrounding areas. Get a fast, free local estimate." />
    
    <!-- Simple, fast CSS styling embedded directly to avoid complex CSS configurations -->
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
      header { background: #1b4332; color: white; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
      .logo { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
      .phone-link { color: #52b788; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .hero { background: linear-gradient(rgba(27,67,50,0.85), rgba(27,67,50,0.85)), url('https://unsplash.com') center/cover; color: white; padding: 4rem 2rem; text-align: center; }
      .hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; color: #d8f3dc; }
      .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
      @media (max-width: 768px) { .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .form-box { background: white; padding: 2.5rem; rounded-radius: 8px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 5px solid #2d6a4f; }
      .form-box h3 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1b4332; }
      .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
      .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #444; }
      .form-group input, .form-group text-area, .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; }
      .submit-btn { background: #2d6a4f; color: white; border: none; padding: 1rem; width: 100%; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
      .submit-btn:hover { background: #1b4332; }
      .privacy-note { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; margin-top: 1rem; text-align: center; line-height: 1.3; }
      .content-box h2 { color: #1b4332; margin-top: 0; }
      .content-box ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; }
      .content-box li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      footer { background: #112211; color: #888; text-align: center; padding: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
      footer a { color: #bbb; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <header>
  <div class="logo-container" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
    <!-- Clean, lightweight vector Tree Stump Logo -->
    <svg xmlns="http://w3.org" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="#52b788" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M2 22h20" />
      <path d="M5 22v-5c0-3 2-5 5-5h4c3 0 5 2 5 5v5" />
      <path d="M12 12V7c0-2-1-3-3-3" />
      <path d="M14 12V5c0-1.5 1-2.5 2.5-2.5" />
      <circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1" fill="#52b788" />
      <circle cx="15" cy="19" r="1" fill="#52b788" />
      <circle cx="9" cy="18" r="1" fill="#52b788" />
    </svg>
    <span class="logo" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.3rem; color: white;">Grand River Stump Removal</span>
  </div>
  <div>
    <!-- Your active mobile click-to-call link -->
    <a href="tel:6395600100" class="phone-link" style="color: #52b788; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">
      <span>📞</span> <span class="phone-text">Click to Call / Text</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Professional Tree Stump Grinding</h1>
      <p>Fast, reliable, and affordable yard restoration services across Paris, Brantford, and the County of Brant.</p>
	  <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #52b788; margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: 500;">
	  ✉️ Email: <a href="mailto:yourbusinessemail@gmail.com" style="color: #d8f3dc; text-decoration: underline;">grandriverstumpremoval@yahoo.com</a>
	  </p>
    </section>

    <main class="container">
      <section class="content-box">
        <h2>Local Yard Maintenance Solutions</h2>
        <p>Don't let ugly, rotting tree stumps ruin your lawn or damage your lawnmower blades. We help connect local homeowners with specialized stump technicians equipped to clear any size roots safely.</p>
        
        <h3>📍 Areas We Serve:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Paris</strong> (North Paris, Mile Hill, Rest Acres area and Downtown)</li>
          <li><strong>Brantford</strong> (North End, West Brant and downtown core)</li>
          <li><strong>County of Brant</strong> (St. George, Burford, Cainsville)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>✔️ What to Expect:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Free local project assessments</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Deep root system grinding</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Eco-friendly lawn prep and clean up</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- This plain HTML form hooks directly into Netlify's automatic database detection system -->
      <!-- Enhanced Form Box with Photo Upload Instructions and Trust Badges -->
<section class="form-box">
  <h3>Get Your Free Estimate</h3>
  
  <!-- Visual Photo Hint Placeholder Box -->
  <div style="background-color: #f4f9f6; border-left: 4px solid #2d6a4f; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: start;">
    <span style="font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1;">📸</span>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #1b4332; line-height: 1.4;">
      <strong>Tip for an instant quote:</strong> Snap a quick photo of your tree stump and text it directly to our dispatch line at <strong>639-560-0100</strong> right after submitting your form!
    </p>
  </div>

  <form name="stump-leads" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/success/">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="name">Your Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="John Doe" />
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
      <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required placeholder="519-555-0123" />
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="location">Neighborhood/City</label>
      <input type="text" id="location" name="location" required placeholder="e.g., North Paris (Griffith Dr)" />
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="size">Estimated Stump Diameter (Inches)</label>
      <select id="size" name="stump-size" required style="height: 44px; width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; background-color: white;">
        <option value="">-- Select Size --</option>
        <option value="small">Small (Under 12 inches)</option>
        <option value="medium">Medium (12 to 24 inches)</option>
        <option value="large">Large (Over 24 inches)</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <!-- Spaced and styled submit button -->
    <button type="submit" class="submit-btn" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; background: #2d6a4f; color: white; border: none; padding: 1rem; width: 100%; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;">
      Submit Quote Request
    </button>
    
    <!-- Trust Badges & Guarantees section -->
    <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px dashed #e0e0e0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #2d6a4f; font-weight: 600;">
        <span>🛡️</span> <span>Fully Insured Operators Available</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #2d6a4f; font-weight: 600;">
        <span>🌿</span> <span>Lawn-Safe, Compact Equipment Used</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #2d6a4f; font-weight: 600;">
        <span>🏡</span> <span>Proudly Serving Brant County Neighborhoods</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="privacy-note" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #666; margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;">
      *By submitting, you consent under PIPEDA guidelines to allow our local service coordinator to forward your basic project specs to a verified regional contractor for calculation purposes. Your data is never sold or spammed.
    </p>
  </form>
</section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Grand River Stump Removal. Operating in Ontario, Canada.</p>
	  <!-- Clean contact footer link layout -->
  	  <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0;">Contact: <a
	  href="mailto:yourbusinessemail@gmail.com">grandriverstumpremoval@yahoo.com</a></p>
      <p><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>